Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.14 59/69] fscache, cachefiles: remove redundant variable 'cache'
Date:   Wed,  5 Dec 2018 04:42:37 -0500
Message-Id: <20181205094247.6556-59-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.17.1
In-Reply-To: <20181205094247.6556-1-sashal@kernel.org>
References: <20181205094247.6556-1-sashal@kernel.org>
